{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/joint-letter-to-local-authorities-on-the-crisis-and-resilience-top-up-for-heating-oil-support","content_id":"05caecf9-d7f9-4915-a1a3-e308e3dfbb87","description":"Letter to local authorities about the Crisis and Resilience top up for heating oil support.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69c2a679a661abbaa1cf9dcf","filename":"Crisis_and_Resilience_fund_to_support_low-income_heating_oil_households.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":226373,"filename":"Crisis_and_Resilience_fund_to_support_low-income_heating_oil_households.pdf","id":"9203647","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Joint letter to local authorities on the Crisis and Resilience top up for heating oil support","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c2a679a661abbaa1cf9dcf/Crisis_and_Resilience_fund_to_support_low-income_heating_oil_households.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This joint letter from the Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness and the Minister of State for Employment was sent to relevant local authorities on 16 March 2026.</p>\n\n<p>The letter confirms allocations for the Crisis and Resilience top up to support low-income households with increases in heating oil prices.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-24T15:45:39Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_dow